  "methodology": "Hand-authored synthetic queries over a fixed persisted world corpus. Baseline reproduces the previous token-overlap scorer and priority tie-break. Revised calls production recall. Both receive identical eligible durable memories, query scope and eight-result budget. All cases, including known limitations, enter aggregate metrics. No model calls, fixture-derived scoring parameters or answer-string rules.",
